# ============================================================================
# VERCEL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES - ADD THESE TO VERCEL DASHBOARD
# ============================================================================
# 
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Go to https://vercel.com/dashboard
# 2. Select your SEEDCHAIN-MINOR-PROJECT
# 3. Go to Settings > Environment Variables
# 4. Add each variable below for the appropriate environment (Production/Preview/Development)
#
# ============================================================================
# FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (artifacts/seedchain)
# ============================================================================

# Supabase Configuration (for authentication & real-time features)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://joeoubchvrtdwlqhpywm.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_KXhLWIWKoWt-LzXcKUZDCA__5jUBTDY

# (Optional) API Base URL - if using a separate backend service
# If deploying backend separately, update this to your backend URL
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-domain.com

# ============================================================================
# BACKEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (artifacts/api-server)
# ============================================================================
# 
# NOTE: Only needed if deploying API server separately (e.g., on Railway, Render, or as Vercel Function)
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://seedchain:seedchain@your-postgres-host:5432/seedchain
# FRONTEND_URL=https://your-vercel-domain.vercel.app

# ============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS FOR VERCEL
# ============================================================================
#
# STEP 1: Configure Frontend (artifacts/seedchain)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Open https://vercel.com/dashboard
# 2. Click on SEEDCHAIN-MINOR-PROJECT
# 3. Go to Settings > Environment Variables
# 4. Add these variables for Production:
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_URL = https://joeoubchvrtdwlqhpywm.supabase.co
#    - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = sb_publishable_KXhLWIWKoWt-LzXcKUZDCA__5jUBTDY
#
# STEP 2: Configure Build Settings
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to Settings > General
# 2. Build Command: pnpm run build
# 3. Output Directory: artifacts/seedchain/dist/public
# 4. Install Command: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
#
# STEP 3: Deploy
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Just push to GitHub - Vercel will auto-deploy on every push to main branch
#
# STEP 4 (Optional): Deploy Backend
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If deploying API server, create a NEW Vercel project for artifacts/api-server:
# 1. Create new Vercel project from GitHub
# 2. Set Root Directory: artifacts/api-server
# 3. Add environment variables:
#    - DATABASE_URL (your PostgreSQL connection string)
#    - FRONTEND_URL (your frontend Vercel domain)
#
# ============================================================================
# FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES SUMMARY
# ============================================================================
#
# These are used by the React frontend (artifacts/seedchain):
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#   Purpose: Supabase project URL for authentication
#   Default: https://joeoubchvrtdwlqhpywm.supabase.co
#   Required: Yes
#   Scope: Production, Preview, Development
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   Purpose: Supabase anonymous/public key for client-side auth
#   Default: sb_publishable_KXhLWIWKoWt-LzXcKUZDCA__5jUBTDY
#   Required: Yes
#   Scope: Production, Preview, Development
#
# ============================================================================
# BACKEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES SUMMARY
# ============================================================================
#
# These are only needed if deploying the API server (artifacts/api-server):
#
# DATABASE_URL
#   Purpose: PostgreSQL connection string
#   Format: postgresql://user:password@host:port/database
#   Required: Yes (for backend)
#   Scope: Production
#
# FRONTEND_URL
#   Purpose: Where the frontend is deployed (for CORS and redirects)
#   Example: https://seedchain.vercel.app
#   Required: Yes (for backend)
#   Scope: Production
#
# PORT
#   Purpose: Port to run the API server
#   Default: 8080 (set automatically by Vercel for serverless functions)
#   Required: No (Vercel sets this)
#
# ============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
# ============================================================================
#
# Frontend (seedchain)
# ☐ GitHub repository connected to Vercel
# ☐ VITE_SUPABASE_URL added to Environment Variables
# ☐ VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY added to Environment Variables
# ☐ Build Command: pnpm run build
# ☐ Output Directory: artifacts/seedchain/dist/public
# ☐ Install Command: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
# ☐ Test deployment at: https://your-project.vercel.app
#
# Backend (api-server) - Optional
# ☐ Separate Vercel project created for API
# ☐ Root Directory: artifacts/api-server
# ☐ DATABASE_URL configured
# ☐ FRONTEND_URL configured
# ☐ Test API at: https://your-api.vercel.app/health
#
# ============================================================================
